      "sourceTextSha256": "54ebe9f9f21b24784df8ba88c173e3d28c3a3a87b64a4f3d514e02d458cf2165",
      "text": "Time to relax on the coast and explore at your own pace.\n\nBúzios is about **176 km north of Rio de Janeiro**. The former fishing village became a well-known resort thanks to its unusual coastline, tropical vegetation and numerous beaches with clear turquoise water.\n\nAfter the busy sightseeing programme in São Paulo, Iguazu and Rio, these 2 days are set aside for quiet time by the sea, walks and your own plans.",
